; mumchimp.com -- the committed copy of the zone.
;
; Regenerate:  .venv/bin/python scripts/dns_zone.py --export --zone mumchimp.com
; Check drift: .venv/bin/python scripts/dns_zone.py --check  --zone mumchimp.com
;
; TTLs are not recorded on purpose. Lowering a TTL before a cutover is a routine act and
; must not read as drift. See docs/MIGRATION_AND_DR_PROGRAM.md M9.

_dmarc.mumchimp.com   TXT    "v=DMARC1; p=quarantine; adkim=r; aspf=r; rua=mailto:support@mumchimp.com;"
api.mumchimp.com      CNAME  prospector-store-api.fly.dev.
mumchimp.com          A      66.241.124.37
mumchimp.com          AAAA   2a09:8280:1::130:427c:0
mumchimp.com          MX     5 smtp.google.com.
mumchimp.com          NS     danica.ns.cloudflare.com.
mumchimp.com          NS     tony.ns.cloudflare.com.
mumchimp.com          TXT    "v=spf1 include:_spf.google.com include:spf.mailjet.com ~all"
www.mumchimp.com      CNAME  prospector-store-web.fly.dev.
